{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0H23", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{Z}_x \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Z}_y \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\pi$", "MATH_0004": "$|\\mathcal{Z}_x| = \\{x\\}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{Z}_x \\to \\mathcal{Z}_y$", "MATH_0006": "$\\pi$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Z}_y$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{Z}_x$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{Z}_x$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0011": "$x$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-gerbe-bijection-points}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-gerbe-smooth}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{stacks-properties-definition-residual-gerbe}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:31e0fe42d33d22ec553b4c7477e112dfff2ee3aa574745fa6234a7864811ee62", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c75ba12b4d390905458b76ab2947db3ee421b2b8a5a3696bb96719da3fcf73d5", "source_text": "The morphism <MATH_0001> is a monomorphism as\nthe base change of the monomorphism <MATH_0002>.\nThe morphism <MATH_0003> is a universal homeomorphism by\nLemma <REF_0001> and hence <MATH_0004>.\nFinally, the morphism <MATH_0005> is smooth\nas a base change of the smooth morphism <MATH_0006>, see\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nHence as <MATH_0007> is reduced and locally Noetherian, so\nis <MATH_0008> (details omitted). Thus <MATH_0009> is\nthe residual gerbe of <MATH_0010> at <MATH_0011> by\nProperties of Stacks, Definition\n<REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:84ad318a11483db92ab86e6d9e9cadfe54a9edbe281df60fdf9c390ad6b3a040", "unit_id": "tag:0H24:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0H23", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$x \\in |\\mathcal{X}|$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{I}_\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$|f|(|\\mathcal{Y}|)$", "MATH_0006": "$\\{x\\} \\subset |\\mathcal{X}|$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{Z}_x$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0011": "$x$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-every-point-residual-gerbe}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-every-point-residual-gerbe-locally-Noetherian}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-factor-through-residual-space}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4a45a3156a4c475ab02be4a642154eabb8f75c2f61a1a1e7b936a1b0beef7fd6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5280940b3aab6ddbcc4b90dc4986be0f1ef1457467ae77dec804a6fae2621cc8", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a point. Assume\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003> is decent or locally Noetherian (or both),\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004> is quasi-compact,\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0005> is contained in <MATH_0006>, and\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0007> is reduced.\n<STRUCT_0006>\nThen <MATH_0008> factors through the residual gerbe <MATH_0009>\nof <MATH_0010> at <MATH_0011> (whose existence is guaranteed by\nLemma <REF_0001> or\n<REF_0002>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f62199fc8ac8a07f61689f5bd683f012610d46ca9667065f0500a8d57d91d032", "unit_id": "tag:0H25:statement"}
